uxfullsource proofs retained. MachineK0-K7withP3waiver rc0 using ORIGINAL actualCodex4 prepushM5/K4 source; this does NOT satisfy pendinghumanassurance and does not claim postpushhuman-onlyK4 passed/backdate. Claude5 changes_requested/fullscopefalse/launcher16 and AUX12STOP unchanged; not approval/assurance. Freshhuman route reads immutableGitHubsource, no waiver or relabel of failedClaudeexecution.\n\nExisting scoped merge/land authority retained. After actual human ownverdict/exactdelivery/v2: freshrefs/rules/head/solelease/currentconnector/K0K7, Ready/auto review, normalmerge actualM, canonicalMCI officialartifact/fullsourceAUX thenM8/readback/actualUTCretirement/D1D4. CHƯA ĐỦ ĐIỀU KIỆN MERGE: thiếu human audit thực tế. No Ready/merge/land/LIVE orWindowsCI.",
